  "video_link": "",
  "rating": "5",
  "item_short_desc": "<p>Our Womens EMT Pants are specially designed to provide first responders with the function, comfort, and protection they need on the job. These cargo work pants are built to last through the toughest circumstances and emergencies. In addition, the medical uniform pants are designed with comfort in mind, allowing you to focus on the situation at hand.</p>",
  "no_ratings": "0",
  "sort_order": "7205",
  "description": "<p>Our Womens EMT Pants are specially designed to provide first responders with the function, comfort, and protection they need on the job. These cargo work pants are built to last through the toughest circumstances and emergencies. In addition, the medical uniform pants are designed with comfort in mind, allowing you to focus on the situation at hand. Built for Performance: These EMS pants provide the flexible toughness you need on the job. With reinforced knees, an expandable / stretch waistband, and low waist style, you'll be able to move quickly while maintaining a professional look. Utility Pockets: Be prepared for anything with the EMT work pants&rsquo; 9-pocket design: 2 large bellow cargo pockets (with vertical instrument pocket on the right leg pocket), 2 large-capacity back pockets, 2 front slash pockets, an inner accessory pocket, and an inner pouch pocket for carrying scissors, flashlights, medical gear, emergency supplies, work essentials, and more. Perfect Fit: The EMT cargo pants feature a secure and comfortable waist closure with dual hook &amp; bar fasteners and zipper fly for all-day comfort while out on the job. First Responder-Focused: Rothco carries a massive selection of EMT, EMS, paramedic, and first responder clothing and gear that is specially designed to support the crucial, fast-paced tasks medical professionals face on the job.</p>",
